  "description": "The Class 3 Union 2 electric bike is fully loaded to get things done. Built on a sleek aluminum frame with internal cable routing, this e-Bike is powered by a Bosch Performance Line Speed motor and a Powertube 500Wh battery. The Bosch Kiox on-board computer provides ride data at your fingertips via a handlebar remote and easy-to-read color display. The Kiox is compatible with Bluetooth heart-rate monitors for the ultimate smart eBike experience. A 10-speed Shimano drivetrain fine-tunes your pedaling, while Tektro hydraulic disc brakes keep your speed under control. Wide tires on 27.5-inch wheels take the sting out of rough pavement. With built-in Lezyne lights, an integrated rack, and reflective fenders, the Union 2 lets you cut through city traffic with ease and confidence. Learn more about e-bike rebates in your state.*Limited time only, while supplies last.",
